64-bf5e7fbf730f" :question/worked-solution "- $C$ is upper triangular: **false**. The entry in row 2, column 1 is $1\\ne 0$, below the main diagonal.\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 0 & 6 & 0 \\\\ -2 & -4 & 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $C$ is lower triangular: **true**. All entries above the main diagonal are zero.\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 0 & 6 & 0 \\\\ -2 & -4 & 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- ${C}^{T}$ is upper triangular: **true**. All entries below the main diagonal are zero.\n\n$$\n{C}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"] [:db/add "6b0a4f8b-16a3-585d-9864-bf5e7fbf730f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "6b0a4f8b-16a3-585d-9864-bf5e7fbf730f" :question/answer-fields "f3d833fb-15aa-5bde-964f-513cdc8a0547"] [:db/add "6b0a4f8b-16a3-585d-9864-bf5e7fbf730f" :question/answer-fields "b03c609d-bb7b-5caf-80da-043bccc84be8"] [:db/add "6b0a4f8b-16a3-585d-9864-bf5e7fbf730f" :question/answer-fields "9c7cadf1-b618-5101-9f58-314c30946a81"] [:db/add "6b0a4f8b-16a3-585d-9864-bf5e7fbf730f" :question/answer-fields "e26c96ed-3ade-5e26-bf8e-8264dfed2635"] [:db/ensure "6b0a4f8b-16a3-585d-9864-bf5e7fbf730f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186119784 :knowledge-point/questions "6b0a4f8b-16a3-585d-9864-bf5e7fbf730f"] [:db/add "d5c4cd69-eb07-5fdf-975d-905a39fbe301" :answer/id #uuid "d5c4cd69-eb07-5fdf-975d-905a39fbe301"] [:db/add "d5c4cd69-eb07-5fdf-975d-905a39fbe301" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "d5c4cd69-eb07-5fdf-975d-905a39fbe301" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "d5c4cd69-eb07-5fdf-975d-905a39fbe301" :answer/validate] [:db/add "223d1634-6ba8-598d-a6aa-4802f5af3959" :answer/id #uuid "223d1634-6ba8-598d-a6aa-4802f5af3959"] [:db/add "223d1634-6ba8-598d-a6aa-4802f5af3959" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "223d1634-6ba8-598d-a6aa-4802f5af3959" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "223d1634-6ba8